    "description": "DIAGNOSTIC ARM D6 — test whether hand_tuned MOTOR values (authority=1.5, force=2.0, damping=1.5) are what regress stage 1 standing vs the springs themselves.  This arm keeps the hand_tuned G6DOF spring values (hip1=8/hip2=7/knee=7 with damping 1.5) but RESETS motor_authority_scale, motor_force_scale, and joint_angular_damping to body @export defaults (1.0/1.0/0.3).  If standing recovers → motor values were the regression.  If still brittle → springs themselves or some other override is.  Requires OGMA_PICRAWLER_JOINT_BACKEND=g6dof to make springs actually effective.",
